  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Let VRChat integrate the use of multiple avatar systems in their game and let users choose the systems they want to use with the avatar systems provided in the SDK versions. I think it would be great to maintain the integrity of avatar 2.0 system, yet also have the ability to have and further the new avatar 3.0 system. There's a lot of people who like the avatars that might eventually be rendered outdated as their authors don't update them with the latest SDK. It would be good to preserve these avatars to the greatest ability so that avatars can ongoingly be enjoyed regardless of what version of SDK and Unity.",
